# Network Communication Initiated To Portmap.IO Domain | T1041, T1090.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/network_connection/net_connection_win_domain_portmap.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=3 Initiated="true" DestinationHostname="*.portmap.io"
